1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC, "Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:48,480
(The Grave of Ruan Zheng Feng)

4
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,360
(Episode 10: Dripping With Jealousy)

5
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,600
I wonder...

6
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:22,400
if Ms. Dong would even care for such material items.

7
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,040
It's quite interesting, don't you think?

8
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,080
A second marriage.

9
00:02:26,081 --> 00:02:27,920
What's there to celebrate?

10
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,159
Mom, it's getting late.

11
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:32,200
You should get some rest. I'll be heading back now.

12
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,720
Where are you going?

13
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,800
Back to Mingchen.

14
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,920
What's so good about Mingchen?

15
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,040
You don't even want to come home anymore.

16
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,600
Don't move.

17
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,840
I'm not moving.

18
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:52,960
You say we're even,

19
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,800
but you're still holding a grudge.

20
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,600
Me? Holding a grudge?

21
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:59,400
If you're not, why are you staring at me so fiercely?

22
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,520
I'll close my eyes then.

23
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,960
There.

24
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Thank you.

25
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,560
You're welcome.

26
00:03:23,561 --> 00:03:24,601
I haven't thanked you yet.

27
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,880
Thank me?

28
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:27,880
For what?

29
00:03:27,881 --> 00:03:29,121
For what you did for my mentor.

30
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,920
Isn't that what I should have done?

31
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,760
Why thank me for that?

32
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,079
Thank you for standing...

33
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,760
in the shoes of us frontline employees...

34
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,000
and speaking up for us.

35
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,280
Eat up.

36
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,360
Thanks for the meal.

37
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:05,280
I've really never seen this before.

38
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,360
The visitor makes the patient cook for them.

39
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,480
This is so delicious.

40
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,440
Mr. Fu, you've got some skills.

41
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,200
Maybe the noodles are just good.

42
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,760
Try the side dishes.

43
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,440
Aren't you eating?

44
00:04:35,441 --> 00:04:37,016
You go ahead. I don't have much appetite.

45
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,360
You should eat at least a little.

46
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,000
It's no fun eating alone.

47
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,880
Food tastes better when shared by two people.

48
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,480
Where are you going?

49
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,480
- Eat this while it's hot. - Thank you.

50
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,960
It tastes pretty good. Try it.

51
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,216
It's been less than three seconds.

52
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,240
It's clean.

53
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,640
I didn't realize you were so frugal.

54
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:45,840
Let's go.

55
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,280
Over there.

56
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,640
This place has quite an atmosphere.

57
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:17,680
Black and white photos.

58
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,720
That looks so creepy.

59
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,640
Mom, this is the trend now.

60
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,280
This... This is just too scary.

61
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,440
It's bad luck, isn't it?

62
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,920
I knew it.

63
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:33,960
She's wearing plain colors again today.

64
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,160
Standing there looking all delicate.

65
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,440
It makes me look so over-the-top.

66
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,320
Like a peacock.

67
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,759
Mom, everyone has their own personal style.

68
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,760
Look.

69
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,640
Even her lipstick is so light.

70
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,720
It makes me feel way overdressed today.

71
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,120
As if it were my own wedding anniversary.

72
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,799
Mom, if you don't like Ms. Dong,

73
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,296
don't come when she's around next time.

74
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,320
That won't work.

75
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:58,680
My gallery still needs to collaborate with her.

76
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,400
Ms. Dong.

77
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,320
Mrs. Fu, there you are.

78
00:07:05,321 --> 00:07:06,599
You look wonderful.

79
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,879
That dress is so beautiful.

80
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,999
Yours is lovely too.

81
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Very elegant.

82
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,240
Thank you.

83
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,720
Ms. Dong.

84
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,240
Ming Yu, I received the necklace you sent.

85
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,480
I really love it. Thank you for being so thoughtful.

86
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,920
He wasn't the thoughtful one.

87
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,400
I was the one who picked it out.

88
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:21,999
He's just a young man.

89
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,280
What does he know about jewelry?

90
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,199
Then I should thank you for the effort.

91
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,079
Don't mention it. I'm glad you like it.

92
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,120
I love it, I really do.

93
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,480
Mrs. Fu.

94
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,159
Mrs. Fu and Ming Yu.

95
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,800
You're here! See?

96
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,240
I told you so.
It's a small gathering.

97
00:07:35,241 --> 00:07:36,880
Just a few families who know each other.

98
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:37,960
This is wonderful.

99
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:41,280
I haven't seen Mr. Fu in a long time.

100
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,320
I'm going to hog him for a while.

101
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,216
Listen to your choice of words.

102
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,440
Don't I know him well enough?

103
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,976
He would rather come early on his own...

104
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,440
than come here with me.

105
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,439
Mrs. Fu, you're being unfair to Mr. Fu.

106
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,719
Look, he's coughing from frustration.

107
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,720
Let me tell you,

108
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,840
Mr. Fu is not someone just anyone can invite.

109
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,759
How many times have I asked him out for tea...

110
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,920
and chat about life?

111
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,080
He completely ignored me.

112
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,320
If it weren't for you,

113
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,360
I wouldn't be able to see him at all.

114
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,639
I've finally caught you now. Come here.

115
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,159
I need to talk to you about life.

116
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,839
- Yes, talk about life. Go on. - Look at this.

117
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,319
I really have business to discuss. I really do.

118
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,560
You guys go ahead and catch up.

119
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,199
- Indeed. - Look.

120
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,400
Hello, Mr. and Mrs. Zheng.

121
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,200
Well, if it isn't Mr. Fu.

122
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,720
How do you have time for this today?

123
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,520
I'm not as free as you usually are.

124
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,240
See that? They've been bickering since they were kids.

125
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:26,880
You An.

126
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,320
Have you greeted Ms. He?

127
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,880
Hello, Ms. He.

128
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,960
An An, long time no see.

129
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,679
I didn't see you at your mom's art exhibition...

130
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:40,720
last time.

131
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,240
What has she been busy with?

132
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,360
She set up a studio recently.

133
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,200
She's been incredibly busy.

134
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,776
If it weren't for this gathering today,

135
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:48,959
we wouldn't have seen her at all.

136
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,960
That's true.

137
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:52,080
That's how it is when kids grow up.

138
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,400
Look at our Ming Yu.
He's the same way.

139
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,120
All year round,

140
00:08:56,121 --> 00:08:57,320
I barely get to see him.

141
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,680
And now,

142
00:08:58,681 --> 00:09:00,216
he's going to Ma'ao on a business trip.

143
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,480
How many days will you be gone?

144
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,176
You certainly know my schedule well, Mom.

145
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,200
Of course I do.

146
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,400
Ming Yu is going to Ma'ao too?

147
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,960
Is something the matter?

148
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,080
Nothing's the matter.

149
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,159
An An, didn't you say a couple days ago...

150
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,336
that you were going to Ma'ao too?

151
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,160
You even insisted on going alone.

152
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,520
We couldn't talk you out of it.

153
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,840
That's good.

154
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,920
You see, An An is studying photography.

155
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,216
In the future, she'll inevitably be traveling all over the world.

156
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,240
It's wonderful.

157
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:25,400
But she's a woman, after all.

158
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,600
We're still a little worried.

159
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,119
- True. - What's there to worry about?

160
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,599
It's so convenient to go to Ma'ao now.

161
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,560
Besides, there are drivers everywhere.

162
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,400
And I have my own friends in Ma'ao.

163
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,560
Is that any way to talk to your mother?

164
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,240
She's just concerned about you.

165
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,400
Ming Yu, how are you getting there?

166
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,080
Quite a few people are going this time.

167
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,720
It should be a business jet.

168
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,520
How about this?

169
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,280
Ming Yu, if it's not too much trouble,

170
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,760
take our An An along with you.

171
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,720
That way, the two of us can rest easy.

172
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,400
Is that convenient?

173
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,920
No, it's not convenient at all.

174
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,240
I'm going there for fun,

175
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,439
while he's going for work.

176
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,920
- Yes. - I don't want to trouble him.

177
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,399
You two grew up together.

178
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,416
She used to follow you around,

179
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,879
calling you "Brother Ming Yu".

180
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,880
- Yes, exactly. - It's no trouble at all.

181
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,240
Listen.

182
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,800
While Ming Yu is working,

183
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:26,360
she can just stay in the hotel.

184
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:28,400
And when Brother Ming Yu is off work,

185
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:31,000
she can keep him company.

186
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,200
Mrs. Fu, what do you... No.

187
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,000
Ming Yu, what do you say?

188
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,879
- Mr. Zheng, this... - It's settled then.

189
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,040
Let Ming Yu...

190
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,600
make all the arrangements.

191
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,840
Okay?

192
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,080
Mrs. Fu,

193
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:46,560
you're always so thoughtful.

194
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,240
It's the least I can do.

195
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,480
Don't mention it.

196
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,119
Mr. Fu, can you...

197
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,800
stop looking so gloomy?

198
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,760
You're making Ming Yu nervous.

199
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,599
Everyone else is having a good time,

200
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,600
but he's the only one...

201
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:04,800
who's still working.

202
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,600
I know.

203
00:11:06,601 --> 00:11:08,440
You have high hopes for your son.

204
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,840
When he was a kid,

205
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,656
if he got second place instead of first,

206
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,840
you would give him a beating.

207
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,519
My son was always at the bottom,

208
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,520
and I never bothered him.

209
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,119
And look at him now, isn't he still alive and kicking?

210
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,120
He's doing just fine.

211
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:19,600
Are you done yet?

212
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,680
Don't try to make your son's lack of ambition sound so noble.

213
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,400
If you had the choice now,

214
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,200
would you dare to entrust...

215
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,600
your entire airline to Yan An?

216
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,040
Don't even think about it.

217
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:37,320
Don't bring up my sore spots, will you?

218
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,360
At the root of it, the two of us are just different.

219
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,680
What's my philosophy?

220
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:43,856
Raising children for old age.

221
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,799
We work hard all our lives, but what for?

222
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,240
Isn't it so the next generation...

223
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:49,480
doesn't have to suffer and struggle like we did?

224
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,200
Look,

225
00:11:51,201 --> 00:11:52,559
whenever Yan An is free,

226
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,080
he comes to chat and fish with me.

227
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,640
Isn't that nice?

228
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,000
Enjoying family time.

229
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,480
Now look at you.

230
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:00,200
If Mr. Zheng hadn't organized this,

231
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,520
would you even see your son?

232
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,600
Whether you like it or not,

233
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,760
I'm saying this for your own good.

234
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,759
By the way, don't you always tell your son,

235
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,056
"I'm doing this for your own good"?

236
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,120
Get out of here.

237
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,080
Even laughing? Have a drink.

238
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:17,959
(Ruan Si Xian's Pinned Posts)

239
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,159
(Today)

240
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:22,400
(Goodnight.)

241
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:32,000
(Smooth takeoff and landing)

242
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:37,440
(Ruan Zheng Feng)

243
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:30,440
Dad, I'm here to see you.

244
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,880
These are my epaulets.

245
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,240
Right now,

246
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,080
I have three stripes.

247
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,720
In a few years,

248
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,560
I'll have four stripes.

249
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,600
Do you know what four stripes mean?

250
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,160
It means...

251
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:13,640
I'll be a captain.

252
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,360
It's such a shame.

253
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,120
You've never even been on a plane.

254
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,400
If you could've held on for a few more years,

255
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,760
maybe...

256
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,800
you could've flown on my plane.

257
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,800
I could've taken you abroad.

258
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,160
It has been really windy...

259
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:48,800
these past few nights.

260
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,280
Outside the window,

261
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,560
the wind was howling.

262
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:57,840
In my daze,

263
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,760
I thought I was back in our old house.

264
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,680
Xiao Zhen always says...

265
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,480
the apartment I'm living in now is very high-end.

266
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,160
But I really feel it can't compare to our home.

267
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,080
Besides,

268
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,640
there's a really annoying person living upstairs.

269
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,560
Well, calling him annoying...

270
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,440
isn't exactly right.

271
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,080
After all,

272
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,120
he has his good and bad moments.

273
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,480
Why am I telling you about him?

274
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Dad,

275
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:49,240
just forget everything I just said.

276
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,000
I'll just...

277
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:00,160
stay here quietly with you for a while.

278
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:23,760
(Jiangcheng International Airport)

279
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,160
Ms. Ruan.

280
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,880
Why are you walking so fast?

281
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:29,560
Are you out of shape?

282
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,720
I'm walking so slowly.

283
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:31,960
Hurry up.

284
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:16,559
(Fu Ming Yu)

285
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:17,679
(Yellow Warning For Thunderstorms and Wind Gusts)

286
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,536
(Within six hours, thunderstorms will affect the local area...)

287
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:20,760
How have you guys been lately?

288
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,200
Don't ask.

289
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,480
Does he think you're too tall?

290
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,280
I'm not even wearing heels.

291
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,240
Neither am I.

292
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,480
Exactly.

293
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:33,480
(Fu Ming Yu)

294
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,600
(Ruan Si Xian)

295
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,160
Remember to bring an umbrella.

296
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,720
Mr. Fu,

297
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,799
you're out with your girlfriend, yet you're worrying about me.

298
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,920
That's not very appropriate.

299
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,760
Girlfriend?

300
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,879
(Fu Ming Yu)

301
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,200
She's not my girlfriend.

302
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:27,320
Mr. Fu,

303
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,800
would you like some yogurt milk?

304
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,000
No.

305
00:19:31,320 --> 00:19:32,320
It's too sour.

306
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,240
You have it then, You An.

307
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:36,800
You don't want it either.

308
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,680
Then I'll drink it myself.

309
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,880
It really is quite sour.

310
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:47,319
Hello, sir. The plane will take off soon.

311
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,920
Please turn off your electronic devices.

312
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:53,280
Mr. Yang, we have water, coffee, and other beverages available.

313
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,600
What would you like to drink?

314
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,679
- A cup of water, please. - Thank you.

315
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:58,560
Ma'am, please fasten your seat belt. Thank you.

316
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:03,160
Sir, please straighten your seat back.

317
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,679
Why aren't you replying?

318
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:24,040
(Ruan Si Xian)

319
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:52,359
(Ma'ao)

320
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,999
Yan An, I advise you,

321
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,280
you had better show up right in front of me immediately.

322
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:58,639
Otherwise, even if luck is on your side today,

323
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,960
I'll show you that your fate is in my hands, not heaven's.

324
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,680
I'm here.

325
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,320
What's all this?

326
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,000
Free milk tea I just got.

327
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,600
The young master of Bo'ao,

328
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,920
trying to fool me with free stuff?

329
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,160
When it comes to money,

330
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,639
save where you can and spend where you must.

331
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,719
And the reason I'm saving money...

332
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:18,759
is to ensure that...

333
00:21:18,760 --> 00:21:19,960
for the rest of the day today,

334
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:21,679
I can serve you wholeheartedly.

335
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:22,880
You can do whatever you want.

336
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:26,800
Is it sweet enough?

337
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,800
I need some dopamine right now.

338
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:30,680
Then you need me.

339
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,000
Let's go.

340
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:34,200
Quick, take this. Let's go.

341
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,400
Come on.

342
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:42,880
What should I do?

343
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:46,800
I want to try every flavor.

344
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,279
Look, it's not that I'm stingy,

345
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:52,919
but there's still so much other delicious food ahead.

346
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:54,640
Don't fill yourself up on just ice cream.

347
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:56,280
But I can't choose.

348
00:21:58,800 --> 00:21:59,800
How about this?

349
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,999
Pick the two flavors you want to try the most.

350
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,840
If you can't finish them, I'll eat the rest.

351
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:09,199
Three at most. No more. Think about it.

352
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:11,079
If you pick four and only take one bite of each,

353
00:22:11,080 --> 00:22:12,560
how am I supposed to finish the rest?

354
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:14,680
Deal.

355
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,600
I'll have chocolate and cantaloupe.

356
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:21,640
And lemon, please. Thank you.

357
00:22:25,080 --> 00:22:26,080
Thank you.

358
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:32,040
Not bad. You still have good taste.

359
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,400
Of course.

360
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:35,520
Every time I come to Ma'ao,

361
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:37,920
as soon as the plane lands, I have to have this ice cream.

362
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:39,239
But let me tell you, save some room.

363
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,560
There's a lot of good food ahead.

364
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:42,776
Have you got it all planned out?

365
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:44,519
Why do I need a plan when I'm here?

366
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:46,200
Who are you looking down on? Let's go.

367
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:53,920
Stop showing off.

368
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:18,360
Long time no see, Mr. Cai!

369
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,440
Hey, handsome!

370
00:24:19,760 --> 00:24:21,200
It's been so long since you visited.

371
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:25,240
You're finally dating!

372
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:27,280
Don't talk nonsense.

373
00:24:27,281 --> 00:24:28,961
She's a friend I've known since childhood.

374
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:32,800
So childhood sweethearts then.

375
00:24:33,120 --> 00:24:34,720
You're a bit chatty today.

376
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:36,680
Two orders with extra beef intestines and offal.

377
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:38,239
Sure thing.

378
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,360
It's on the house.

379
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:41,799
Just remember to invite me to your wedding.

380
00:24:41,800 --> 00:24:43,120
You'll definitely be invited.

381
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:44,679
I'll still pay. I'll transfer it to you.

382
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:46,879
- Here you go. Yours. - No way, this is so much!

383
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:48,816
How am I supposed to eat anything else after this?

384
00:24:48,840 --> 00:24:49,919
We'll get going then.

385
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,959
Thank you.

386
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:52,400
- Bye. - Bye.

387
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,400
What's wrong?

388
00:24:55,800 --> 00:24:56,800
I'm fine.

389
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:58,000
It's my period.

390
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,559
(Fu Ming Yu: She's not my girlfriend.)

391
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:03,600
(Why aren't you replying?)

392
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,200
Ruan Ruan.

393
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,400
Have some hot water.

394
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:08,840
Careful, it's hot.

395
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:11,440
- Thank you. - I could tell you were unwell.

396
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,840
How about I call a cab to take you home?

397
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,400
It's okay.

398
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:17,120
I'm going to Mingchen Apartments today.

399
00:25:17,360 --> 00:25:18,440
My best friend lives there.

400
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,720
You, come with me.

401
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,120
Nice shot!

402
00:25:48,800 --> 00:25:49,800
You An.

403
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:55,520
You An.

404
00:25:57,800 --> 00:25:58,840
You An, are you okay?

405
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,200
I'm coming in.

406
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,560
You An.

407
00:26:07,320 --> 00:26:08,960
You An, why are you on the floor? You An!

408
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:10,640
Get up.

409
00:26:12,040 --> 00:26:13,040
Where does it hurt?
My stomach hurts.

410
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:16,840
Your stomach? Come, I'll carry you to the bed.

411
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:18,200
Come on.

412
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:22,320
Careful now.

413
00:26:22,960 --> 00:26:24,600
Hang in there. I'll go call for a doctor.

414
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:30,519
Hello? I need a doctor right now.

415
00:26:30,520 --> 00:26:32,240
Send a doctor up to my room. Hurry, please!

416
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,640
I'll get you some water.

417
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,040
Here, do you want some water?

418
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,760
- No. - Then don't drink.

419
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:46,559
Hang in there. I've spoken to the front desk.

420
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:47,680
A doctor will be here soon.

421
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,200
I'm right here with you.

422
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:51,560
Don't be afraid.

423
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,600
If it hurts, just cry it out.

424
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:54,960
I'm right here with you.

425
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:02,600
You went back to your hometown?

426
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:04,440
Then you...

427
00:27:05,360 --> 00:27:06,360
All right.

428
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:07,440
I'm fine here.

429
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,640
I'll let you get back to work then.

430
00:27:16,040 --> 00:27:17,680
I'll just take a taxi back.

431
00:27:18,320 --> 00:27:19,320
Thank you.

432
00:27:19,321 --> 00:27:20,401
Come to my place for a bit.

433
00:27:20,840 --> 00:27:21,840
It's just upstairs.

434
00:27:22,360 --> 00:27:23,840
I had better not trouble you.

435
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,200
Okay.
Go home on your own then.

436
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:30,880
Your skirt is stained.

437
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:33,120
Where?

438
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,240
Is it big? Is it obvious?

439
00:27:35,560 --> 00:27:36,560
It's this big.

440
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:43,800
Then I had better go to your place to wash it.

441
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:57,200
Just lie down.

442
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,520
I have some brown sugar at home.

443
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:59,600
I'll make a drink for you.
Thank you.

444
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:02,360
I'll never drink ice water again.

445
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:27,240
(Fu Ming Yu: She's not my girlfriend.)

446
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:29,160
Why are you telling me this?

447
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:32,400
It's as if you're explaining yourself to me.

448
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:36,519
(Fu Ming Yu)

449
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:37,600
(Oh, I see.)

450
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,760
I was busy and didn't see it.

451
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:56,360
It's rude not to reply to messages.

452
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:03,160
Is this your first day knowing me?

453
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:04,960
I'm not a rude person.

454
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,520
I just have no class.

455
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,680
Ruan Si Xian, quit while you're ahead.

456
00:29:20,080 --> 00:29:22,040
I don't have that much patience for you to waste.

457
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:24,000
Is it because of Zheng You An...

458
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,160
that you're jealous?

459
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:41,720
Mr. Fu, do you have a lot of free time?

460
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:44,079
Aren't you tired of this? Don't you have work or meetings?

461
00:29:44,080 --> 00:29:45,520
Don't you need to rest at this hour?

462
00:29:51,320 --> 00:29:52,320
Ms. Ruan,

463
00:29:52,560 --> 00:29:53,920
I didn't mean to eavesdrop.

464
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,160
I just came out to use the bathroom.

465
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:05,960
Ms. Ruan,

466
00:30:06,360 --> 00:30:07,800
you can't talk to him like that.

467
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:10,600
What?

468
00:30:10,601 --> 00:30:11,761
If you talk to him like that,

469
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,320
it'll easily backfire.

470
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,280
You have to use the right approach.

471
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,120
Since you know I'm busy,

472
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:24,800
let's call a time-out.

473
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,280
I'll be back next Saturday.

474
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:28,039
Come back whenever you want.

475
00:30:28,040 --> 00:30:29,040
Why tell me?

476
00:30:29,120 --> 00:30:31,000
Do you want me to roll out the red carpet...

477
00:30:31,040 --> 00:30:32,600
and welcome you with a megaphone?

478
00:30:54,840 --> 00:30:55,840
What did you just say?

479
00:30:57,080 --> 00:30:58,160
Even if you care about him,

480
00:30:58,320 --> 00:30:59,680
you shouldn't show it like that.

481
00:31:00,520 --> 00:31:02,280
You have to take it step by step.

482
00:31:02,400 --> 00:31:03,880
If you ask so many questions at once,

483
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,160
he'll find you annoying.

484
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,280
Why would I care about him?

485
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:07,399
Do I care if his brain...

486
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:08,760
needs an upgrade or a reboot?

487
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:11,480
I'm trying to give you some advice.

488
00:31:11,481 --> 00:31:12,521
If you won't listen, fine.

489
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,080
No need to be so mean.

490
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,440
Drink this.

491
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:23,840
I'm not drinking that.

492
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:25,560
Fine, then don't.

493
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:28,200
I'll never mess with you again.

494
00:31:28,600 --> 00:31:29,760
When you get crazy,

495
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:31,280
you even scold the boss.

496
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:33,360
I definitely couldn't beat you in a fight.

497
00:31:33,560 --> 00:31:34,560
I've heard about it.

498
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,600
You're a beast at the fitness tests.

499
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:53,040
Drink it.

500
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,920
Come on in.

501
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:19,040
Welcome to my humble abode.

502
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,440
It's not that humble.

503
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:24,120
Look around. Just give me a second.

504
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:37,000
Why don't you take a hot shower first?

505
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,680
Don't catch a cold.

506
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:40,880
Thanks.

507
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:42,960
Give me your coat.

508
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:46,640
The bathroom is...

509
00:32:46,840 --> 00:32:47,840
It's right through there.

510
00:32:48,320 --> 00:32:49,320
Thanks.

511
00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:54,280
The T-shirt is new.

512
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,240
Got it.

513
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:08,240
This is to prevent a cold.

514
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,000
Careful, it's hot.
Thanks.

515
00:33:12,160 --> 00:33:13,160
Let me.

516
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:32,920
What are you grinning for?

517
00:33:33,520 --> 00:33:34,520
Nothing.

518
00:33:34,760 --> 00:33:35,800
I just feel...

519
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:38,200
like I've hit the jackpot.

520
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:41,920
Commander Zhen,

521
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:45,040
a little gambling is fun, but too much is bad for you.

522
00:33:53,320 --> 00:33:54,680
("Our 10 Years Together" No. 32)

523
00:33:58,400 --> 00:34:00,160
Gao Mu's "Alone" series.

524
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,640
Do you read this too?

525
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,720
I have the whole set.

526
00:34:03,520 --> 00:34:04,640
I think she's so cute.

527
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,720
I think you're cute too.

528
00:34:10,240 --> 00:34:11,240
No, I'm not.

529
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:13,440
Actually,

530
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:15,320
I've always thought...

531
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:17,560
I would be like Gao Mu,

532
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:18,760
living my life alone.

533
00:35:00,440 --> 00:35:01,440
There, all done.

534
00:35:04,040 --> 00:35:05,600
Thank you.

535
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:12,240
Come with me.

536
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:14,440
What for?

537
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:17,360
What is it? Why so mysterious?

538
00:35:23,720 --> 00:35:24,720
Oh my gosh!

539
00:35:24,960 --> 00:35:26,680
You... You have so many!

540
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,440
They're all the latest editions.

541
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:31,440
Oh my gosh.

542
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:33,040
Isn't this heaven?

543
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:34,960
You even have these!

544
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:37,039
I usually have no one to talk to about this.

545
00:35:37,040 --> 00:35:38,040
I love them so much.

546
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:41,000
Can I open it and take a look?

547
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:42,600
Sure.

548
00:35:46,680 --> 00:35:47,680
Oh my gosh.

549
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,080
These are all original copies.

550
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,240
Well, they're certainly not pirated.

551
00:35:51,600 --> 00:35:53,160
I only read pirated ones as a kid.

552
00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:55,440
Some of them were passed around the whole class.

553
00:35:57,760 --> 00:35:59,560
How's this? I'll send you my door code.

554
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:00,960
If you want to read them,

555
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:02,400
you can come over anytime.

556
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,120
- Really? - Really.

557
00:36:11,080 --> 00:36:12,080
Then this time,

558
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:14,040
I'll borrow these first.

559
00:36:15,720 --> 00:36:16,720
Okay.

560
00:36:47,640 --> 00:36:48,976
Your hand gets cold during an IV drip.

561
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:50,016
If I keep it warm like this,

562
00:36:50,040 --> 00:36:51,040
you can sleep better...

563
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,680
and won't have to worry about moving it.

564
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:27,440
You An.

565
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:29,160
Bai Yang.

566
00:37:29,240 --> 00:37:30,240
Are you feeling better?

567
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:33,560
Mr. Fu asked me to bring you some breakfast.

568
00:37:34,080 --> 00:37:35,080
It's very light.

569
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:36,839
Once the doctor comes and finishes your checkup,

570
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,200
you can eat if everything is fine.

571
00:37:39,240 --> 00:37:40,240
Did Fu Ming Yu come?

572
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:43,600
He did. He came as soon as Mr. Yan called him yesterday.

573
00:37:44,240 --> 00:37:46,136
He had an urgent meeting this morning, so he had to leave.

574
00:37:46,160 --> 00:37:48,040
What about me? I'm here to look after you both.

575
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:50,039
Call me if you need anything.

576
00:37:50,040 --> 00:37:51,280
I'll be right outside the door.

577
00:37:52,680 --> 00:37:53,680
Get some rest.

578
00:38:13,680 --> 00:38:15,800
Mom, Mingchen Apartments, Building One.

579
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:17,320
Are you here?

580
00:38:18,160 --> 00:38:19,880
Okay, I'll be right down.

581
00:38:24,560 --> 00:38:26,840
Ms. Ruan, I'm feeling much better now.

582
00:38:27,160 --> 00:38:28,440
Do you want me to walk you down?

583
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,760
No, it's fine.

584
00:38:29,761 --> 00:38:30,921
My mom is here to pick me up.

585
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,480
Thanks for yesterday.

586
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:35,920
You're welcome.

587
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:47,480
Ms. Ruan,

588
00:38:47,680 --> 00:38:48,680
actually,

589
00:38:49,200 --> 00:38:51,240
pursuing someone really requires some strategy.

590
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:52,840
- Especially... - Especially what?

591
00:38:53,520 --> 00:38:54,999
Especially with a man like Mr. Fu.

592
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:56,680
Isn't your mom waiting for you downstairs?

593
00:38:57,080 --> 00:38:58,759
How old are you to still need your mom to pick you up?

594
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,320
You're old enough to be a mom yourself.

595
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:05,880
I'm leaving.

596
00:39:13,440 --> 00:39:14,440
What's it to you?

597
00:39:14,441 --> 00:39:15,640
I'll always be my mom's baby.

598
00:39:16,240 --> 00:39:17,240
Mom.

599
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:19,520
Are you okay?
Much better.

600
00:39:26,360 --> 00:39:27,896
I had some brown sugar water yesterday.

601
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:30,400
Good. I'll make you some ginger tea when we get home.

602
00:39:30,720 --> 00:39:31,720
And braised pork.

603
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,040
I want to eat braised pork, Mom.

604
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:50,599
(A blue sky and white clouds. A pleasant surprise!)

605
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:51,840
The scarf Mom designed.

606
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:54,640
(The scarf Mom designed.)

607
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:56,960
(Xian)

608
00:40:05,560 --> 00:40:06,560
Even an unreliable guy like him...

609
00:40:06,561 --> 00:40:08,200
can have such a considerate side.

610
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:10,360
Sorry for the trouble, everyone.

611
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:18,120
Isn't that Bai Yang?

612
00:40:22,720 --> 00:40:24,880
If she's not your girlfriend,

613
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,920
why did you let her on your plane?

614
00:40:28,160 --> 00:40:30,416
If she's not your girlfriend, why did you take her to Ma'ao?

615
00:40:30,440 --> 00:40:31,560
You even held her hand.

616
00:40:35,080 --> 00:40:36,080
Scumbag.

617
00:40:37,520 --> 00:40:39,720
So where are you going next?

618
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:42,200
I will go to Miami for the meeting.

619
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:44,000
When are you leaving?

620
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:46,160
Tomorrow. Thank you, sir.

621
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:48,119
- Okay. All the best. - Yes.

622
00:40:48,120 --> 00:40:49,456
- Okay, see you next time. - See you.

623
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,600
See you. Have a good trip.

624
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:03,800
Baby, look.

625
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:05,560
Yes, I missed your calls.

626
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,920
I've been busy.

627
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:09,280
I've been in meetings with Mr. Fu.

628
00:41:09,600 --> 00:41:11,439
Yes, I just finished and came out.

629
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,600
I just saw your calls.

630
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:14,560
Are you going to sleep? Okay, go to sleep.

631
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,880
Okay.

632
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:17,280
Have fun.

633
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:21,840
I'm sorry, Mr. Fu.

634
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:23,360
Well...

635
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,880
She scolds me if I don't check in.

636
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:28,496
But if I contact her too much, she says I'm annoying.

637
00:41:28,520 --> 00:41:29,520
One word.

638
00:41:30,320 --> 00:41:31,320
Difficult.

639
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:33,080
You just said if you contact her too much,

640
00:41:33,680 --> 00:41:34,840
she'll find you annoying.

641
00:41:34,920 --> 00:41:36,240
Of course, very annoying.

642
00:41:36,720 --> 00:41:38,160
Either she says I don't contact her,

643
00:41:38,560 --> 00:41:40,560
or she complains that I text her every day.

644
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:42,640
In the world of romance, it's all about two words.

645
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:44,560
Have some boundaries.

646
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:48,880
Isn't that three words?

647
00:41:50,440 --> 00:41:51,440
Three words.

648
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:54,320
So your wife is like that too.

649
00:41:56,560 --> 00:41:58,119
It's nothing. What day is it today?

650
00:41:58,120 --> 00:41:59,160
Wednesday.

651
00:41:59,680 --> 00:42:00,680
Okay.

652
00:42:01,320 --> 00:42:02,320
Okay.

653
00:42:11,240 --> 00:42:13,280
What we need to pay special attention to today...

654
00:42:13,600 --> 00:42:14,600
is our return flight.

655
00:42:14,601 --> 00:42:15,880
About 50 minutes after takeoff,

656
00:42:16,040 --> 00:42:18,080
the aircraft will encounter a thunderstorm area.

657
00:42:18,240 --> 00:42:20,480
So we must inform the cabin crew immediately.

658
00:42:41,200 --> 00:42:42,680
Flying requires a sense of reverence.

659
00:42:43,160 --> 00:42:44,160
Reverence for life.

660
00:42:44,280 --> 00:42:45,280
Reverence for duty.

661
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:46,480
Reverence for regulations.

662
00:42:57,600 --> 00:42:58,680
It's already three o'clock.

663
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:01,800
Saturday?

664
00:43:03,760 --> 00:43:05,079
I feel like someone...

665
00:43:05,080 --> 00:43:06,760
mentioned something about Saturday to me.

666
00:43:09,040 --> 00:43:10,040
Xiao Ruan.

667
00:43:11,240 --> 00:43:12,240
Mr. Bai?

668
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:15,480
Mr. Fu would like you to go to his office.

669
00:43:15,840 --> 00:43:16,840
Me?

670
00:43:18,800 --> 00:43:19,800
Is something wrong?
Nothing's wrong.

671
00:43:20,840 --> 00:43:22,000
He just wants you to go over.

672
00:43:22,120 --> 00:43:23,120
Let's go.

673
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,520
What is he up to now?

674
00:43:40,440 --> 00:43:41,440
I have another meeting.

675
00:43:41,560 --> 00:43:42,560
Wait a moment.

676
00:43:54,000 --> 00:43:59,120
(Departing Ep. 10 for Ep. 11)
